        <p><span>11.4</span>The Customer agrees and undertakes that, during the Term and for a period of one year thereafter, it shall not, directly or indirectly, either individually or otherwise, solicit or induce, attempt to solicit or induce, divert, hire, retain (including as a consultant) any employee, officer, agent, director, contractor, business partner or such other persons of ClearTax (“<strong>Cleartax Personnel</strong>”) or any former Cleartax Personnel engaged with ClearTax in the preceding twelve months.</p>
