        <p><span>11.12</span><strong>Assignment:</strong> The Customer shall not assign any of its rights and obligations under the Agreement without the prior written consent of ClearTax. ClearTax may assign or novate any or all of its rights and obligations under the Agreement or any part thereof including but not limited to the right to payments, to any of its Affiliates and successors in order to exercise any of the rights or perform any of the obligations under the Agreement.</p>
